' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899062-2' /></span></strong> during Tet to bring good luck and happiness.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17.7778px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6298%; height: 122.258px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/images/exams/ornamental_tree_215510f4.png\" alt width=\"160\"></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3988%; text-align: left; height: 122.258px;\">Families prepare a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.4</label><input id='fbo-899062-3' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='3' name='fbo-899062-3' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899062-3' /></span></strong>, like a peach or kumquat, to decorate their homes for Tet.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
