      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using the words in the box. You may need to change the form of the words. Use each word only once.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 36px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>spirit</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>bonding</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>release</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>maintain</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br>1. Cooking traditional dishes together during Tet strengthens family <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.1</label><input id='fbo-899092-0' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='0' name='fbo-899092-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899092-0' /></span></strong> and creates happy memories.</p>\n<p>2. On Tet, many people <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.2</label><input id='fbo-899092-1' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='1' name='fbo-899092-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899092-1' /></span></strong> birds into the sky to wish for peace and luck.</p>\n<p>3. Vietnamese families have <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.3</label><input id='fbo-899092-2' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='2' name='fbo-899092-2' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899092-2' /></span> </strong>the custom of gathering for a big meal during the Lunar New Year.</p>\n<p>4. During Tet, families hang decorations on bamboo poles to keep bad <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.4</label><input id='fbo-899092-3' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='3' name='fbo-899092-3' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899092-3' /></span></strong> away from their homes.</p>",
