      "hint": "",
      "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Từ loại cần điền:</span> <strong>trạng từ</strong>, để bổ nghĩa cho cả câu, mô tả cách thức hoặc bối cảnh mà hành động \"<strong>families prepare Chung cake</strong>\" diễn ra.</p>\n<style>\n    .vocab-table-sharp-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        background-color: #ffffff; \n        border: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        border-radius: 10px; \n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp td {\n        padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;\n        color: #1c581f;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        vertical-align: top; \n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    \n    .vocab-table-sharp td:first-child {\n        border-right: 1px solid #ceedca;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp tr:last-child td {\n        border-bottom: none;\n    }\n\n    .word-en-sharp {\n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n        font-size: 14px; \n    }\n\n    .word-pos-sharp {\n        color: #5fbd18; \n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n    }\n    \n    .word-pron-sharp {\n        color: #333333;\n    }\n\n    .example-sharp {\n        margin-top: 6px;\n        color: #555555;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .eq-highlight {\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .meaning-en-sharp {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n        color: #222222;\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">tradition</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(n.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈtrædɪʃn/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">Celebrating Tet is a long-standing <span class=\"eq-highlight\">tradition</span> in Vietnam.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">a belief, custom, or way of doing something that has existed for a long time</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>phong tục, truyền thống</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f6e3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">traditionally</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adv.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/trəˈdɪʃənəli/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Traditionally</span>, people exchange gifts on this special occasion.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">according to or by tradition</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>theo truyền thống</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<details style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #5fbd18; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 0;\">Xem thêm các từ cùng gốc khác</summary>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">traditional</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/trəˈdɪʃənl/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">Many people enjoy <span class=\"eq-highlight\">traditional</span> Vietnamese food during holidays.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">following or belonging to the traditions of a group or society</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>thuộc về truyền thống, truyền thống</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">traditionalist</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(n.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/trəˈdɪʃənəlɪst/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">My grandfather is a <span class=\"eq-highlight\">traditionalist</span> who believes in old customs.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">a person who has great respect for tradition and does not like change</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>người theo chủ nghĩa truyền thống</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">traditionalism</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(n.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/trəˈdɪʃənəlɪzəm/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">His strong <span class=\"eq-highlight\">traditionalism</span> often clashed with modern ideas.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">respect for tradition, especially in opposition to modernism</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>chủ nghĩa truyền thống</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</details>",
