      "explanation": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 523px;\"><iframe id=\"B6D47CED\" src=\"https://azvocab.ai/embed/SL?params=U2FsdGVkX1%2Frp%2Bvm15wbAA2QIYMNxx18xcchbw08Zi3Pp4N52cmYuDwMMgfuj2DDlX1Zi4iQhVsd0KXDaYT1n7U21xoUgwpGEEwUy%2FxtgSI0kimU8zbFYVBF4jrk3pmtSsLSHGYPcuin1CRIZJxyFO5edNNYzai2jSN%2FI07da8ySinselrUHbajZcx7tI16blxmRjcSRXoIsn3RtpuWcIYJ1%2Fj97GiqjY2GWrwg8dY2x%2FV%2BHJzedzmnNfjDVpTqaY9OzGlCMfoeSjMK%2F5VT9mLGjwqoASPamXR3b1mpBkOKtvWfdzQa0tgwcWqRFQJJe7JS%2FA8Jdxz3Z61T7HYruD9%2BwQDgXjkiCkvC7O6ULn2I%3D\" width=\"100%\" height=\"275\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div>\n<p>Dịch: Người Việt Nam thích những m&oacute;n ăn truyền thống như b&aacute;nh chưng và nem v&agrave;o dịp Tết Nguy&ecirc;n đ&aacute;n.</p>",
